        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion Modern Square Polished Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Square Deadbolt has a modern look that is not only exemplified by its clean lines, but also by the deadbolt thumb-turn. Most deadbolts look the same on the interior: giant, old fashioned designs; but this stainless steel door lock made by Fusion looks contemporary even down to the smallest detail. It is made out of stainless steel and is a <b>polished (shiny) finish</b>.  It is adjustable  for door thicknesses 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches and works with the most common door backsets of 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Polished Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Square Polished Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished (Shiny)</b></li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder</b> -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Item Discontinued\r\n\r\n\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
